# Hardened Academic's "whenever one or more cards leave your graveyard" looks back to the board as it was before the event
# (CR 603.10a), so a card put onto the battlefield from the graveyard - an enters-the-battlefield event for other abilities
# (CR 603.6a) - triggers it only if it was on the battlefield then. Bot1 Entombs the Academic and Reanimates it: it was in
# the graveyard, not on the battlefield, as it left, so it gets no +1/+1 counter. Reanimate costs 2 life (18).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Entomb
Reanimate
Island
Island
Island
Hardened Academic
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Hardened Academic)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Hardened Academic)
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Jet; Hardened Academic
Bot1.Battlefield.Hardened Academic.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Hardened Academic.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard = Reanimate; Entomb
